And here they come...






The spoiler hits!






The spoiler hits!






You die....





But wait...your amulet of life-saving begins to glow...




You feel much better.

Telepathy will only work when you are blind.  This can be caused by
some monsters' attacks, by eating some rotten food, or by drinking a
potion of blindness.  The preferred method, though, is by wearing a
blindfold (or a towel, I think), for the obvious reasons that you can
control when it starts and stops.

But beware!  Telepathy will only let you see creatures with minds.
Molds, some undead, and maybe some other monsters too are exempt.
 
